        "park__edge": "plain",
        "lake__edge": "plain"
      },
      "$comment": "Wetland stays plain in every view. There are 333,526 of them and essentially none carry a regulation, so colouring them by closure painted the province's largest layer in a rules colour that meant nothing."
    },
    {
      "id": "conditions",
